   "line": 3,
   "text": "Now a nasty surprise. The same tone, a quarter turn behind, scores zero. So take a backward wheel, turning clockwise, test with both its shadows, left-right and up-down, and treat the two sums as an arrow. Its length is four, whatever the phase. That length is the match.",
