   "line": 6,
   "text": "Against the one thousand hertz wheel, the arrows close an octagon and end where they began: exactly zero. Any whole number of turns of difference does the same. So test only with whole-turn wheels. Each one is a bin: bin k makes k turns in a block of N samples. The list of their matches is the DFT.",
